{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-alerts-panel-forms-b-01","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-3","surface":"panel","area":"panel/forms","refs":["F-panel-402","F-panel-403","FN-L5-panel-pay-machines-05"],"severity":"S3","title":"\"The receipt will be made by itself in a minute\" is only true while someone has Today open","what":"When a member pays a payment link but the receipt cannot be saved on the open payment sheet, or the sheet was closed before they paid, the desk is told the receipt will be made by itself in a minute. In fact the receipt is only made by the Today page, every 5 minutes while Today is on screen. Until then the member still shows the money as owed everywhere. After 15 minutes the check that stops the desk taking the same due again no longer sees that online payment, so the desk can take cash for a due the member already paid online. The owner only finds out later, from a 'Paid online, receipt not made' card.","expected":"A paid link becomes a receipt on the server, or on whatever screen the desk has open, within the promised time. The check before taking cash keeps seeing a paid link until its receipt is made.","evidence":["apps/dashboard/src/crm/pay/CollectOnline.tsx:13-14","apps/dashboard/src/crm/pay/CollectOnline.tsx:99-101","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/Today.tsx:175","apps/dashboard/src/crm/pay/PaidOnline.tsx:1-12","apps/dashboard/src/crm/pay/PaidOnline.tsx:164-170","deploy/panel/pay.js:68","deploy/panel/pay.js:1207-1219","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/forms/CollectPaymentSheet.tsx:126-133"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"online-receipt-made-only-on-today","who":"gyms with online payment links on","how_often":"each time a link is paid while nobody has Today open","fix_line":"Make the receipt on any admin page (or on the server), and keep the before-cash check seeing paid links until their receipt exists","fix_size":"medium","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-alerts-panel-forms-b-02","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-4","surface":"panel","area":"panel/forms","refs":["F-panel-405","F-panel-404","FN-L19-panel-ui-shell-01"],"severity":"S3","title":"Reward days given by hand after a workout check still show on Today as a reward to give","what":"After checking a member's workout code, the owner taps Give extra days and the Freeze / extra days sheet adds 3 gift days. That only moves the plan's last day. The workout offer keeps its own 'given' mark on the server, which only its own Give button sets. So Today still says '1 reward to give' for the same member, and when the desk taps it the member gets the offer's days a second time. The reverse is also true: the hand gift never knows the offer already gave days.","expected":"One reward, one mark. Giving the reward from the member page marks the offer reward as given, so Today drops it and nobody can give it twice.","evidence":["apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/forms/ExtendMembershipSheet.tsx:47-51","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/forms/ExtendMembershipSheet.tsx:62-69","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/MemberDetail.tsx:848-853","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/WorkoutCodeCheckSheet.tsx:1-6","apps/dashboard/src/crm/logic/workoutOffer.ts:255-257","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/Today.tsx:591-611","supabase/migrations/0025_workout_offer.sql:273-299"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"hand-gift-skips-offer-given-mark","who":"gyms running a workout offer","how_often":"each time a reward is given from the member page instead of Today","fix_line":"Give workout rewards only through the offer's own give step, or have the gift sheet mark the offer reward as given","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
